  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> The Indispensable All-Around Tool for Turning Operations </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Whether you want to adjust and measure tools for lathes, machining centers, or milling centers—with ZOLLER »hyperion,« a single measuring machine is all you need for virtually all of your different tool holders. The various tool holders are fixed on a turret, making them especially quick and simple to use.</strong></p> <p>Whether you choose manual or CNC-controlled operation, with this device you’re opting for maximum versatility and can immediately benefit from a significant increase in productivity thanks to tools that are 100% prepared and inspected.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/d/csm_hyperion_intro_deb7604992.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c3360",
   "bg": "",
