    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "highlight",
   "items": [
    "Flexible turret configuration tailored to your needs ",
    "A single measuring machine for almost all different types of tool holders ",
    "Specialized alloy and robust construction"
   ],
   "header": "",
   "ftype": "zoller_highlight",
   "id": "c3359",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Starting with a batch size of 1 </h3> <h2> 20% increase in productivity </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The universal presetting and measuring machines in ZOLLER’s »hyperion« series guarantee maximum efficiency and flexibility when holding tools horizontally in CNC manufacturing. Tools from virtually all tooling systems are measured and adjusted quickly, simply, and reliably. This means less scrap and machine downtime, higher quality, greater productivity—and higher profits. </p> <p>In short: With ZOLLER »hyperion«, you can manufacture cost-effectively, on time, profitably, and with perfect quality.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/f/csm_revolver_4bf59adaba.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c3370",
