    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> »hyperion« </h2>",
   "body": "<p>With »the »hyperion« 300/500/700«, you’ll have a measuring machine suitable for virtually all tooling systems, giving you a decisive edge over the competition.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/contact\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Request</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">a 1-on-1 consultation with an expert</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/contact\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">now</a></p>",
